{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":11},"Le Grand Partage (The Roommates Party)","Un hiver pire que jamais. Le gouvernement publie un décret obligeant les citoyens français les mieux logés à accueillir chez eux pendant la vague de froid leurs concitoyens en situation précaire. À l’heure du Grand Partage, un vent de panique s’installe à tous les étages dans un immeuble très chic de la capitale. (A winter that's worse than ever before. The government publishes a decree obliging the best housed French citizens to take in, during the cold snap, their fellow citizens living in precarious conditions. A l’heure du Grand Partage, un vent de panique s’installe à tous les étages dans un immeuble très chic de la capitale. At the time of the Great Sharing, a wave of panic spreads to every floor of a very chic Parisian building.)",[4,5,6,7,8,9,10],"urban","independent home","marriage","high rank employment","low rank employment","grandmotherhood","interracial relationships",{"type":12,"id":13,"slug":14,"title":15,"release":18,"filmType":22,"directors":23,"genre":31,"media":33,"synopsis":36,"production":39,"characters":45,"roles":61,"awards":127,"tags":3},"Film","FR2015_179","fr2015-179-le-grand-partage",{"native":16,"english":17},"Le Grand Partage","The Roommates Party",{"type":19,"date":20,"year":21},"Theatrical release","2015-12-23",2015,"Fiction film",[24],{"id":25,"slug":26,"name":25,"birthYear":27,"deathYear":27,"gender":28,"nationality":29,"awards":30},"Alexandra Leclère","alexandra-leclere",0,"Female identifying","France",[],[32],"Comedy",{"posterUrl":34,"trailerUrl":35},"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/225/81/152033/format_page/le-grand-partage.jpg","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IFTk0QtG2Ls",{"native":37,"english":38},"Un hiver pire que jamais. Le gouvernement publie un décret obligeant les citoyens français les mieux logés à accueillir chez eux pendant la vague de froid leurs concitoyens en situation précaire